description:
Build a combinational circuit with two inputs, a and b. There are 7 outputs, each with a logic gate driving it: 
// (1) out_and: a and b 
// (2) out_or: a or b 
// (3) out_xor: a xor b 
// (4) out_nand: a nand b 
// (5) out_nor: a nor b 
// (6) out_xnor: a xnor b 
// (7) out_anotb: a and-not b

